#
# Naming conventions:
#   Active-low signals use the _N suffix.
#   Hierarchical net names from the schematic (e.g. /CPU/A0, Control Logic/MA22)
#   are flattened to their signal portion only.
#
# Note: JTAG dedicated pins (TDI=P63, TMS=P65, TCK=P67, TDO=P122) are fixed
#       in silicon and require no LOC constraints.
#
# Power/GND pins (no constraints needed):
#   VCC (+3V3): P1  P8  P37 P42 P55 P73 P84 P109 P127 P141
#   GND:        P18 P29 P36 P47 P62 P72 P89  P90  P99 P108 P114 P123 P144

